        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6m9eqf-foeqbfym4pcbiij9z51xa",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Your Amazon adventure begins in Manaus, a major city in the Amazon Basin. The very next day, the city gives way to waterways, rainforest, and life at a lodge on the Rio Negro. Over four days, you’ll see the famous meeting of the Rio Negro and the Solimões, have the chance to swim with Amazon pink river dolphins, learn about local life, and head out along the river after dark to look for caimans."
